.TH TOGGLY-FEATURE 1 "2026-09-29" "Toggly CLI" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
toggly-feature \- List, inspect, and manage features
.SH SYNOPSIS
toggly\-cli feature <command>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List, inspect, and manage features
.SS create
Create a new feature definition\&. First\-class filter options (\-\-enable,
\-\-percentage, \-\-targeting\-*, \-\-time\-window\-*) require \-\-environment
and are validated/merged with \-\-environment\-filters via the standard filter
catalog\&.
.PP
.B toggly\-cli feature create \-\-name <name> \-\-feature\-key <key> [\-\-app <id>] [\-\-environment <name>] [filter\-options] [options]
.PP
Aliases: create\-feature.
.SS get
Get a feature by key\&. Requires \-\-app or a context default\&.
.PP
.B toggly\-cli feature get [\-\-app <id>] <key> [options]
.TP
.I key
Feature key
.SS list
List features for an application\&. Requires \-\-app or a context default\&.
.PP
.B toggly\-cli feature list [\-\-app <id>] [options]
.SS update
Update an existing feature definition's metadata, variants, and allocation\&.
\-\-filters / \-\-enable / \-\-percentage / \-\-targeting\-* /
\-\-time\-window\-* set the definition\-level base filters used when
provisioning new environments; per\-environment overrides are set via 'feature
update\-environment'\&.
.PP
.B toggly\-cli feature update \-\-feature\-key <key> [\-\-app <id>] [filter\-options] [options]
.PP
Aliases: update\-feature.
.SS update\-environment
Update feature configuration on a specific environment\&. Combine \-\-enable,
\-\-percentage, \-\-targeting\-*, \-\-time\-window\-*, and/or \-\-filters
(validated via the standard filter catalog), or specify \-\-disable alone\&.
.PP
.B toggly\-cli feature update\-environment \-\-feature\-key <key> [\-\-app <id>] [\-\-env <name>] (\-\-disable | [filter\-options] [\-\-filters <json>]) [options]
.PP
Aliases: update\-feature\-environment.
